# Git workflow

- Branch from **`main`** (not `develop`): `feature/<name>` or `bugfix/<name>`
- PRs target upstream `civictechdc/cib-mango-tree` **`main`**
- Pre-commit: `isort . && black .` and `pytest`
- Do not commit unless the user asks; never force-push main; no secrets
- Docs: `docs/guides/contributing/github_workflow.md`
